OL,3,GNEWSAFormer vicarage turned into
OL,4,Aaffordable homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "exciting" community housing project
OL,7,Faimed at affordable homes for people
OL,8,Fwho grew up in St Ives has been
OL,9,Flaunched.
OL,11,FHousing provider Three Seas Cornwall
OL,12,Fhas worked with St Ives Community Land
OL,13,FTrust to secure funding to bring the
OL,14,Fempty former vicarage in the town back
OL,15,Finto use and plans to offer six flats
OL,16,Fat rents of around #400 a month.
OL,18,FThree Seas Cornwall manager Simon Ryan
OL,19,Fsaid the flats would be "very low rent,
OL,20,Fproperly secure, decent housing for
OL,21,Fpeople who grew up in this community."
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
