OL,3,GNEWSAFormer vicarage turned into
OL,4,Aaffordable homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FTegan Veal, who grew up in St Ives,
OL,7,Fsaid it was hard to find affordable
OL,8,Fhomes in the town and added "finding
OL,9,Fopportunities like this is super
OL,10,Fexciting, heart-warming."
